{"name":"Jack Frost","hex":"#dae6e3","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"Jack Frost","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Proper noun","definitions":["A personification of frosty weather or winter."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/Jack_Frost"}],"entries":[{"title":"Jack Frost","blocks":[{"text":"Jack Frost is a personification of frost, ice, snow, sleet, winter, and freezing cold. He is a variant of Old Man Winter who is held responsible for frosty weather, nipping the fingers and toes in such weather, coloring the foliage in autumn, and leaving fern-like patterns on cold windows in winter."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9b/Jack-frost.jpg/330px-Jack-frost.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jack_Frost","wikidata":"Q626939"},{"title":"Jack Frost (1997 film)","blocks":[{"text":"Jack Frost is a 1997 American direct-to-video black comedy slasher film written and directed by Michael Cooney. It stars Scott MacDonald and Christopher Allport."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/8/8a/Jack_Frost_VideoCover.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jack_Frost_(1997_film)","wikidata":"Q584506"},{"title":"Frost","blocks":[{"text":"Frost is a layer of ice on a solid surface, which forms from water vapor that deposits onto a freezing surface. Frost forms when the air contains more water vapor than it can normally hold at a specific temperature. The process is similar to the formation of dew, except it occurs below the freezing point of water typically without crossing through a liquid state."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b3/Saint-Amant_16_Gel%C3%A9e_blanche_2008.jpg/330px-Saint-Amant_16_Gel%C3%A9e_blanche_2008.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Frost","wikidata":"Q4590598"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Fleur_de_givre_L.jpg/500px-Fleur_de_givre_L.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Fleur_de_givre_L.jpg/1280px-Fleur_de_givre_L.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Fleur_de_givre_L.jpg/500px-Fleur_de_givre_L.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Close-up look at frost crystals.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AFleur_de_givre_L.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/SNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg/500px-SNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/SNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg/1280px-SNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/SNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg/500px-SNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Passenger with SNLC cruise train greeting \"kung Bore\", the Swedish equivalent of Jack Frost, during a stop at the arctic circle in Sweden, 1950s.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ASNLC_stop_at_Arctic_circle.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Nevada-Apartadero-Merida-Venezuela.jpg/500px-Nevada-Apartadero-Merida-Venezuela.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ea/Nevada-Apartadero-Merida-Venezuela.jpg/1280px-Nevada-Apartadero-Merida-Venezuela.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"htt